 result←object position arg;tunits
 tunits←⊃##._supp.MyUnits object
 :If 0=≢arg
     result←tunits÷⍨object ⎕VGET⊂'_position'(0 0) ⍝ Keep in pixels
 :Else
     arg←##.##.Single arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: position'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt arg
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: position'##.##.Error 2≠≢arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: position'##.##.Error∨/arg<0
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: position'##.##.Error∨/arg>object size ⍬ ⍝ Can't set it to anything bigger than the printable size of the page
     object._position←arg×tunits
     result←##.NoRes
 :EndIf
